keting-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-1#invoca-launches-google-ads-messaging-ba4331" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">02 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#triton-reports-agent-agent-audio-c94949" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Triton公布音訊廣告Seller Agent交易案例，事前由人手設定價格與驗證規則</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Triton Digital於10月28日公布Seller Agent，並表示已與Talpa Media及代理商Draft Digital為Otrium完成一宗由AI代理溝通及預訂的音訊廣告交易。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">對代理商與媒體，案例的可參考之處是把審核條件預先轉為交易規則。自動預訂能否適用，仍取決於庫存、定價及責任邊界是否清楚。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-2#triton-reports-agent-agent-audio-c94949" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #3F5BC8;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#3F5BC8">03 / 廣告平台 &amp; 行銷科技 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 18px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#sprinklr-opens-six-agent-marketing-c4b06b" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Sprinklr開放六款行銷AI代理beta，涵蓋創意、執行與合規覆核</a></div><div style="font:13px/1.65 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#4B4D55;padding-top:9px">Sprinklr於10月27日開放Marketing AI Agents beta，列出構思、創意、活動執行、合規、社群及預算優化六款代理，強調策略與審批仍由人負責。</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">對需要跨市場改稿與上稿的大型團隊，可評估代理能否減少交接工作。重點是核對品牌背景與審批鏈，避免將更快製作等與更好成效。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-3#sprinklr-opens-six-agent-marketing-c4b06b" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #DEDBD2;border-top:4px solid #9A3A9E;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#9A3A9E">04 / 行業影響 &amp; 品牌案例 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#sprinklr-survey-27-536-live-c739a8" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Sprinklr調查：536名正式使用AI的受訪者中，27%稱能精確量化結果</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">滿意度與可量化證據是兩種不同訊號。品牌評估AI工具時，可先定義基準、責任人及比較方法，避免把主觀滿意視為已證實ROI。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-4#sprinklr-survey-27-536-live-c739a8" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:9px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" 