v style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#39689F">06 / AI 大模型 &amp; 市場動態 · 影響生意</div><div style="font:800 16px/1.4 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#meta-brings-muse-singapore-phased-c7551f" style="color:#101114;text-decoration:none">Meta Muse擴展至新加坡，購物與旅遊連接功能將逐步開放</a></div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-top:12px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="border-left:3px solid #5A42F4;background:#EBE8FF;padding:10px 12px"><div style="font:800 10px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">MARKETER TAKEAWAY</div><div style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-top:4px">對面向東南亞消費者的零售及旅遊品牌，AI代理的比較、探索與預訂路徑值得納入渠道規劃，尤其要確認產品資料及服務條款能否被準確呈現。</div></td></tr></table><div style="font:700 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;padding-top:11px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=highlight-6#meta-brings-muse-singapore-phased-c7551f" style="color:#5A42F4;text-decoration:none">閱讀完整新聞 &#8594;</a></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:23px 25px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" bgcolor="#EBE8FF" style="background:#EBE8FF"><tr><td style="border-left:4px solid #5A42F4;padding:17px"><div style="font:800 11px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4">TEAM ACTION BOARD</div><div style="font:800 18px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding:7px 0 12px">今日可以跟進嘅方向</div><table role="presentation"><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">01</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">先確認目標市場及beta資格，再用一項非敏感服務測試答案來源、預約準確度與轉介流程。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">02</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">以一種音訊庫存盤點價格底線、預算上限、資料及品牌安全規則，再詢問供應商能否提供可稽核的交易紀錄。</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font:800 12px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#5A42F4;padding:0 9px 10px 0">03</td><td style="font:13px/1.6 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#101114;padding-bottom:10px">向帳戶團隊申請beta資訊，先以一份既有brief檢查市場、語言、素材與合規例外的交接。</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 25px"><table role="presentation"><tr><td bgcolor="#5A42F4" style="background:#5A42F4;border-radius:24px;padding:13px 25px"><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_content=cta" style="font:800 14px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:white;text-decoration:none">閱讀今日完整新聞 &#8594;</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#151841" style="background:#151841;padding:24px"><div style="font:800 16px Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#D3FE66">AI Marketing Daily</div><div style="font:12px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#E5E2EF;padding-top:8px">Curated by Carrie Hui · AI Marketing Intelligence</div><div style="font:11px/1.8 Arial,'PingFang HK','Microsoft JhengHei',sans-serif;color:#B9BADA;padding-top:9px">本電郵為已發佈網站內容精選，原始來源請查閱網站。</div><a href="https://carriehw.github.io/ai-marketing-daily/?lang=zh&amp;utm_source=edm&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=ai-daily-2026-10-29&amp;utm_cont